  "description": "Not a published list: Cybernetics Division: Humanity Upgraded's deck, built in SanSan Stage 10 so the sweeps reach a Corp whose identity takes a card from both players' maximum hand size. On Endless Loop's frame, which keeps every card; in for its cards here: Self-Destruct Chips for a Megaprix Qualifier, point for point, Ryon Knight and Oaktown Grid for Game Changer, Lab Dog and Quicksand for Divert Power, and Little Engine and Clairvoyant Monitor for a Pulse and an Echo. Eternal-legal. SanSan Stage 11 swapped two Vaporframe Fabricator and two BASS-CH1R180G4, each kept by four other decks, for two Pachinko, an Exposé and a Test Ground. SanSan Stage 12 swapped a Caveat Emptor, a Vulnerability Audit and an Elivagar Bifurcation, kept by other decks, for an Early Premiere, a Vanity Project (the same four points) and an Enforcer 1.0.",
